'''Waydurk'''<ref name="Card Trader">{{SWCT|set=The Cloud-Riders|cardname=Waydurk}}</ref> was a [[Mimbanese]] who joined [[Enfys Nest]]'s [[Cloud-Riders]] during the the [[Imperial Era]]. Waydurk participated during the [[Showdown on Savareen|skirmish]] on [[Savareen]]<ref name="Solo" /> and made use of a [[Mimbanese blaster]].<ref name="SWCT">{{SWCT|set=Solo: A Star Wars Story - Gear & Gadgets|cardname=Mimbanese Blaster}}</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Waydurk first appeared in the [[2018]] film ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''<ref name="Solo" /> and was later identified in the [[Star Wars: Card Trader|''Star Wars'': Card Trader]] app.<ref name="Card Trader" />

